{"product_id":"riot-squad-salts-grape-ice","title":"Riot Squad Salts - Grape Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003eGrape Ice nic salt by Riot Squad, tastes just like rich dark grapes are chilled to perfection to provide an authentically moreish inhale laced with an icy chill.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeaturing a 50% VG concentration, this nic salt will produce a discreet amount of vapour for an MTL (Mouth To Lung) inhale. It pairs best with a refillable kit that's designed for MTL vaping.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand Name: Riot Squad\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50%\/50%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 30 ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade In UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20MG \u0026amp; 48MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Riot Squad","offers":[{"title":"20mg","offer_id":41990940295223,"sku":"Riot - Grape Ice 20 mg","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"48mg","offer_id":41990940327991,"sku":"Riot - Grape Ice 48 mg","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Grape-Ice-Nic-Salt-by-Riot-Squad-Salt.webp?v=1763425477","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/riot-squad-salts-grape-ice","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




